      "role": "user",
      "content": "Right, tone color. I guess I was thinking about how those sounds can feel a bit... jarring or out of place sometimes. Does the presence of those inharmonic elements ever create what musicians call \"ghost notes\" or \"phantom frequencies,\" where it feels like there's a second, much quieter presence interacting with the main pitch?",
